## Detection and Log Monitoring Rules (SIEM / EDR)
If you are defending systems against these obfuscated payloads, rely on behavior tracking rather than static text signatures. Security tools can catch these exact anomalies using the specific rules below:
## 1. Checking for Inverted/Reversed Binaries (Sigma Rule Logic)

title: Obfuscated Command Execution via String Reversalstatus: experimentaldescription: Detects command lines attempting to reverse text strings right before launching shell processors (e.g., via rev or PowerShell array indexes).logsource:
